# store (#105)
#
# One SQLite file per host that will hold the lane roster, the lane secrets and
# (later) metrics. In this PR it holds secrets only and nothing on the run path
# reads it: load_config() / fetch_keys() still go to YAML and `pass` until #109.
#
# Encryption is column-level: secrets.ciphertext is AES-256-GCM, everything else
# is plain SQLite so `sqlite3` can still query it. SQLCipher was rejected -- it
# needs a compiled binding on every host and in CI, and its key would live in
# `pass` anyway (epic #105, decision 7).
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
