# Migration N takes user_version N-1 to N. Append, never edit a shipped one: a
# host that already ran it will not run it again.
#
# SQLite 3.34 is the floor (pluto), so no STRICT, RETURNING or DROP COLUMN.
#
# lanes.key_entry deliberately has no REFERENCES secrets(name). A lane can be
# imported before its secret is set -- `db doctor` reports that case -- and a
# foreign key would refuse the lane instead. `secrets rm` checks references
# itself.
